{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2402", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2402/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2402/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2402/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2402", "id": 2530492155, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s6W1D77", "number": 2402, "title": "MAVSDK Ubuntu Release deb contains old file", "user": {"login": "alexcekay", "id": 952431, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjk1MjQzMQ==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/952431?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay", "html_url": "https://github.com/alexcekay", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 5, "created_at": "2024-09-17T09:03:05Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-01T23:10:21Z", "closed_at": "2024-09-19T15:05:38Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "When installing _libmavsdk-dev_2.12.5_ubuntu22.04_amd64.deb_ I can't build the ftp_client example due to the following compile errors:\r\n\r\n`home/alex/MAVSDK/examples/ftp_client/ftp_client.cpp: In function \u2018mavsdk::Ftp::Result remove_directory(mavsdk::Ftp&, const string&, bool)\u2019:\r\n/home/alex/MAVSDK/examples/ftp_client/ftp_client.cpp:73:62: error: \u2018ListDirectoryData\u2019 is not a member of \u2018mavsdk::Ftp\u2019`\r\n\r\nA quick investigation shows that by installing the deb the following header file is included:\r\n_/usr/include/mavsdk/plugins/ftp/ftp.h_\r\n\r\nThe relevant lines of code are as follows in this file:\r\n```\r\n    /**\r\n     * @brief Destructor (internal use only).\r\n     */\r\n    ~Ftp() override;\r\n\r\n    /**\r\n     * @brief Progress data type for file transfer.\r\n     */\r\n    struct ProgressData {\r\n        uint32_t bytes_transferred{}; /**< @brief The number of bytes already transferred. */\r\n        uint32_t total_bytes{}; /**< @brief The total bytes to transfer. */\r\n    };\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen building MAVSDK from source the examples work as the relevant lines of code are as follows in this file:\r\n```\r\n    /**\r\n     * @brief Destructor (internal use only).\r\n     */\r\n    ~Ftp() override;\r\n\r\n    /**\r\n     * @brief\r\n     */\r\n    struct ListDirectoryData {\r\n        std::vector<std::string> dirs{}; /**< @brief The found directories. */\r\n        std::vector<std::string> files{}; /**< @brief The found files. */\r\n    };\r\n```", "closed_by": {"login": "alexcekay", "id": 952431, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjk1MjQzMQ==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/952431?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay", "html_url": "https://github.com/alexcekay", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexcekay/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/alexceka